auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  # roster-demographics.readonly endpoint access (ONEROSTER-58)

  Requests an LEA token holding only the `roster-demographics.readonly` scope, then checks that:

  - `/demographics` returns HTTP 200
  - every non-demographics collection endpoint returns HTTP 403 in the `imsx_*` error envelope

  The token is stored in `lea-rosterDemographicsToken`, separate from `lea-odsApiToken`, so
  other folders keep using the full-scope token.
}
